{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_st02","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_st02","title":"权与力","storyCode":"NL-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"7cebbd2217fd4a15c06d90a99e11e6a9de42f79b1869c79cb69c67926952b7a1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"马克维茨无法忍受锈铜再次被释放的事实，最终选择了拥抱权力。同时，无胄盟主导了对感染者的清洗，然而在玛恩纳的阻挠下，青金大位并未得逞。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您从餐厅回来之后，就一直紧锁着眉头哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果感到疲惫的话，我可以——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你怎么看待今天这场晚宴？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很得体，博士。看来您已经习惯这类交际了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出，虽然常务董事没有亲自露面，但那些企业高管都对您青睐有加......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"你觉得，马克维茨是个怎样的人？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如我之前对您说的，因为耀骑士的事件，有一位发言人引咎辞职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马克维茨是临时顶上这个位置的，在此之前，他只是一个默默无闻的小角色......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他的身上还保留有一些未经洗礼的人情味......不过在现在这个环境，能持续多久可说不太好。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你认为罗德岛的计划，有可行性吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不提这个......您真的信任我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联合会的渗透并非某种组织形式上的渗透......在金钱和确实发生改变的社会面前，即使联合会什么也不做，骑士也会倒向资本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会对罗德岛礼遇的原因几乎和耀骑士密不可分。即使如此，您这样缜密的人......如果不小心对待监正会，是会吃亏的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感谢你的提醒。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这我当然知道。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那么，能告诉我你的意见吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你的意见是？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......锈铜骑士......又，复赛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......毕竟骑士协会根据录像和其他骑士的证词，向国民院证明那位感染者不过是自己过度施法导致的疾病恶化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"死因也是“矿石病”，锈铜骑士并没有直接责任，所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算这是真的......那难道我们就该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拨通国民院副审官的......私人电话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"电话忙音响了两声。\n马克维茨突然回想起了自己童年的时候，父亲的书房桌上，摆着一台黄铜色的电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......发言人阁下，您想出结果了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要恰尔内先生不再掌握证据，就可以了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然......可是我得提醒您，如果事后暴露了，你我都难辞其咎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，杀死他，是最安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向您保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保证我确实......可以堵住恰尔内先生的嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体手段，您就不要过问了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......如果您能拿出诚意的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明天我就会着手重审奥尔默·英格拉的案件，在七天之内，只要您能给我一个足够有诚意的答案......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奥尔默·英格拉就会从此消失在骑士竞技之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......诚意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。至少，您得向我证明恰尔内先生“确实永远不会背叛”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"马克维茨记得，记得那台黄铜色的电话。\n那时的电话还没有如今普及，电缆绕过了酒吧、旅社与轰鸣的工地。\n铃声响起后，悲欢喜怒也会悄然降临。\n这就是卡西米尔的生活......现代生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想您应该明白一件事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是在挑衅一位发言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您和我心里都明白，我只是临危受命，我在董事会里并没有靠山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不代表，我会任您宰割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟的指挥权......曾在恰尔内先生手里。那么现在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......请您不要误会，我并不是在挑战您的权力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是提醒您，确保我们日后的合作顺畅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然您这么说了，那么我也不好咄咄相逼。这确实不太礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要您做担保就行。奥尔默·英格拉说到底只是一个腐朽贵族，他不值得我们伤了感情，您说是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我们似乎没什么好聊的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！马克维茨先生，请等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！麦基先生，您什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没见过你露出那样的笑容，马克维茨兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，无胄盟的命令已经正式下达，你我还是和这件事有一些关系的。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，没什么。继续工作吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，麦基先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"权力永远令人甘之如饴，是吧，马克维茨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚上的街道还真是适合散步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不用工作的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，莫妮克阁下已经带队到达指定地点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"本次行动目标已经明确，现在藏身于这块地区的感染者，约莫在百人左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，能杀就杀吧，上头说了，按数量算钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老规矩，不许对自己人动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"喂、喂！我听说有人看见无胄盟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么......不会吧，这里可是卡瓦莱利亚基的中心！他们敢大开杀戒吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，野鬃不是如你们所愿吸引了无胄盟的注意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，数量太少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们看漏了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做好最坏的准备，远牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要低估无胄盟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，你看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"青、青、青色的长弓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊！？开他娘什么玩笑！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快告诉其他人，分头跑，躲回垃圾场里都没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士A","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"让那些普通感染者不要反抗，千万不要反抗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士B","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"现、现、现在谁能联系到红松骑士团......快......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼哼哼......哼哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，发现三名感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼哼......哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我有提过董事会的报价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个非法感染者三百枚金币，感染者骑士翻倍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......该死！被发现了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个感染者值一张特锦赛门票。一个感染者骑士值半辆好车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个报价单之外的特殊人物，我们该怎么处理呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们接受了几种手势暗语的训练？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我记得好像是三套暗语......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，算了，都忘了吧，如果你们看见我......嗯......打响指的动作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见我打响指的话，就立刻行动，别犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我上去打声招呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"青金罗伊向前走去，路灯几番闪烁。\n青砖一路延伸，街道上空无一人。\n冷清的街边有一张路边椅。\n椅子上又坐着一个冷清的人。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I02_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I02_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，一个美好的夜晚，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打扰您看报了吗？今天的晚报可全是耀骑士的新闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这附近一个人都没有，真冷清，听说这里最近可不太平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您一个人在这里做什么?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗伊......我刚结束工作，只是在这里小憩片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，原来您才下班啊，这个时间？您还怪辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过......您在这里有什么工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这附近应该只有感染者、非法移民和黑市贩子才对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是在等人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你连我等的是谁都要问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，不，怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等人......嗯，等人。难道是在等一位美丽的女性吗？哈哈，开个玩笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我们是有公务在身的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得麻烦您和您的朋友，回避一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你办你的事，我办我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你明白自己在说什么吧，玛恩纳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道我刚才是在用高卢语说话吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别这么说话嘛，您在这里，我手下那些人可会因为紧张而失误的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......玛恩纳，你知道......如果现在我要杀你......得费多少功夫吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伊缓缓抬起了手。\n暗处，无胄盟的刺客已经蓄势待发。\n也许只是错觉罢，这些深藏不露的隐秘大师，总感觉自己被一览无余。\n玛恩纳·临光。\n他们开始祈祷，祈祷罗伊不要发出任何的信号——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I10"},{"type":"narration","text":"白角持剑的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还真是一位......美丽的女性呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来晚了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I02_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I02_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......看我做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你该去工作了，罗伊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":".........嗯......"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗伊的视线与萨卡兹相交片刻。\n他在思考一件事情。\n一会儿该怎么开溜，才不至于太过丢脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，刚才我突然改变了想法。你看，好像后半夜要下雨，我可没带伞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"临光家族试图袒护感染者，我可以这么认为吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"玛嘉烈又获胜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该阻止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是她想要做的，那么我会支持她......我会成为她的支柱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......你？一个萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的事情，我就当已经通知过罗德岛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您出手相助......无胄盟，是个强敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他执意要杀死躲藏在这附近的所有感染者，我想我们没有办法阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是坐在这罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果您想知道玛嘉烈这几年所遭遇的，我愿意把我知道的都告诉您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果您愿意亲口问她的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"看到她的眼神，我就已经明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"她的父亲母亲，甚至是过去的我，谁都拥抱过那样流光溢彩的时代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......您......确实是她真正的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已经知道了该知道的，这之后，我不会再干预半分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以告诉玛嘉烈，告诉那个......“罗德岛”。告诉他们，大骑士领光鲜的外表下，腐烂到了什么地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"但更切实际的建议是，早日离开大骑士领，离开卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"尽力逃离这个时代吧，这才是每个人为数不多的正确选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是个复杂的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"你......别过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的，你是无胄盟吗？你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不对，你是萨卡兹！？你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有敌意，无胄盟已经离开了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才，刚才这个萨卡兹拦在了那些无胄盟面前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么人？你怎么敢和无胄盟作对......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是感染者医师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"一个萨卡兹，自称感染者医师？这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者难民","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......这也太假了......我反而觉得她没有在骗我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......那你打算做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔有提供感染者医疗的手段......既然如此，为什么你们还会躲藏在这里？在这座城市的夹缝中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不是卡西米尔人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"不，说不定大部分卡西米尔人都不知道......慢着，你说你是感染者医师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是零号地块的......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我来自一家医疗企业，你们说的零号地块......是指感染者收容地区吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会出资建立了检查并治疗感染者骑士的收容治疗中心......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闪灵没有急着继续说下去。\n她从面前的感染者眼里看到了疑惑、对自己的不信任、恐惧，以及丝毫的期许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的......不是卡西米尔人，也对，他们是很讨厌萨卡兹的，呃，抱歉，但事实如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在那里治疗过感染者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不感到奇怪吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"那么大一个移动平台，几乎成了感染者骑士的牢笼......你知道吧，感染者骑士在那里接受检查、治疗，同时也在那里“生活”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那种状态能被称为“生活”的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"好，看来你们这些外来者连这件事都不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果把所有的感染者都集中在那里生活......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"地方不够，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"还能赚钱的感染者，会重新走上赛场，或是继续进行一些......劳务工作，什么样的都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"还有些当不上骑士的，会像奴隶一样被派去做一些黑工......矿工，搬运工，而且都是危险的环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果受了伤，连这些基本的工作都做不了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"......你猜猜看，外乡人，你猜猜看那些感染者都从零号地块去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"你们以为那里是医院，骑士们觉得那里是一座监狱。但我告诉你，都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者被送去那里，洗干净尊严，剥下价值，最后送上砧板，任人宰割。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一座漂亮的屠宰场，萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]}]}
